---
interface Props { compact?: boolean }
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<p class={compact ? 'finenote' : 'muted'} style={compact ? '' : 'font-size:0.85rem'}>
  <strong>How votes work:</strong> Season 1 used 2 (best) / 1 (second) per match plus a
  Player-of-the-Round bonus. From Season 2 onward, two voters each award 3-2-1 per
  match — a maximum of <strong>6 per match</strong>. Career totals and the all-time
  boards count Season 1 era-adjusted onto that scale — <strong>a 2 counts as 6, a 1
  as 4</strong> — so a best-on-court night weighs the same in every era; season pages
  and the S1 MVP tally show the votes as cast. Finals are voted separately,
  <strong>4-3-2-1</strong>, for the Finals MVP; those votes never count toward the
  season MVP.
</p>
